WEBVTT

0
00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:51.178
Showbox/Mediaplex, Inc.
United Pictures Present

1
00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:05.195
An Opus Pictures Production

2
00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:10.093
Who is the best subject
to the King?

3
00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:11.999
One who becomes
a great general

4
00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.106
and conquers Liao Dong.

5
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.505
One who is skilled in martial arts
and protects the King.

6
00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:22.112
One who is willing
to die for the King.

7
00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:26.883
Under Yuan's subjugation,

8
00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.988
the Goryeo King selected
young boys

9
00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:31.090
and closely trained them to be

10
00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.192
his royal guards called
the Kunryongwe.

11
00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.294
He allowed these boys
to reside in the palace

12
00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.487
and always kept them
within his reach.

13
00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.396
ZO In-Sung

14
00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.800
JOO Jin-Mo

15
00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:55.710
SONG Ji-Hyo

16
00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:03.873
Your Majesty.

17
00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:08.878
The Princess from Yuan
has arrived at the port.

18
00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:12.583
It is time to go meet
your Queen, Your Majesty.

19
00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:16.293
The court subjects
are waiting, sire.

20
00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:18.795
I haven't finished playing.

21
00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.092
Wait outside.

22
00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:23.793
Producer LEE TAE HUN

23
00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:35.313
Written & Directed by
YOO HA

24
00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:47.987
A Frozen Flower

25
00:03:55.435 --> 00:03:56.299
Stop!

26
00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:57.403
Stop!

27
00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:03.509
Stop!

28
00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:10.681
Stop!

29
00:04:20.026 --> 00:04:20.993
Han-Baek!

30
00:04:22.028 --> 00:04:24.588
You've gone mad over a girl!

31
00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:25.993
How dare you run away!

32
00:04:27.834 --> 00:04:28.892
Chief!

33
00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:31.003
I beg of you.

34
00:04:31.137 --> 00:04:32.695
Please let us go.

35
00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:39.102
Strike me down first
if you must go.

36
00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:44.475
I have no appetite.

37
00:04:46.219 --> 00:04:48.585
Just one spoon, sire.

38
00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:50.889
You must regain your strength.

39
00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:53.891
That'll do, lad.

40
00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:55.995
Just one spoon, please?

41
00:04:56.129 --> 00:04:57.391
Why you...

42
00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:04.694
There.

43
00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:06.696
You may go.

44
00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:09.901
Your Majesty?

45
00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:12.108
Hmm?

46
00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:14.110
Won't you please reconsider?

47
00:05:15.448 --> 00:05:17.780
I won't hear any more
on this matter.

48
00:05:22.121 --> 00:05:26.285
As the Chief, I'm partly
responsible for his actions.

49
00:05:26.426 --> 00:05:29.691
If you must behead him,
punish me in the same regard.

50
00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:31.592
I said, enough!

51
00:05:31.731 --> 00:05:33.096
I beg of you, sire.

52
00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.601
Chief.

53
00:05:43.743 --> 00:05:44.903
Come in.

54
00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:49.107
Brother!

55
00:05:49.248 --> 00:05:50.374
Han-Baek!

56
00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:52.074
Listen carefully.

57
00:05:52.218 --> 00:05:55.585
The King has generously
spared Han-Baek's life.

58
00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:56.889
However...

59
00:05:57.223 --> 00:05:59.191
there will not be
a second chance.

60
00:05:59.325 --> 00:06:02.089
Anyone who disgraces
the Kunryongwe's honor...

61
00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:04.389
will pay with his life.

62
00:06:04.931 --> 00:06:06.489
Yes, sir.

63
00:06:11.237 --> 00:06:12.397
Thank you, sir!

64
00:06:13.639 --> 00:06:14.606
What a relief.

65
00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:17.300
Chief!

66
00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:19.809
Very impressive, sir.

67
00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:27.186
How did you manage
to free him?

68
00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:31.586
He's one of us, we can't
abandon him for one mistake.

69
00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:36.789
The law says to behead the foo
who messes with a court maid.

70
00:06:36.929 --> 00:06:38.396
It's the King's command.

71
00:06:38.531 --> 00:06:39.998
The King's command?

72
00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.291
Why of course.

73
00:06:42.435 --> 00:06:43.402
What?

74
00:06:48.141 --> 00:06:52.202
Stop clouding the King's
judgment with pillow talk, sir.

75
00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:56.972
Stop.

76
00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:08.592
If you speak ill of
His Majesty again...

77
00:07:08.728 --> 00:07:10.093
I'll have your head.

78
00:07:25.645 --> 00:07:29.513
The honeysuckle tea
worked marvelously.

79
00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:32.577
My fever has subsided
drastically.

80
00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.584
It's a relief, sire.

81
00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:37.685
I shall request another batch.

82
00:07:40.226 --> 00:07:44.595
How did you know that
honeysuckle works on fevers?

83
00:07:45.631 --> 00:07:49.590
My late father used to drink it
when he got colds.

84
00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:52.101
I see.

85
00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.905
What would you have done?

86
00:07:57.243 --> 00:07:58.210
Sire?

87
00:07:58.544 --> 00:08:00.205
If you were Han-Baek,

88
00:08:00.646 --> 00:08:02.614
would you have left
the palace too?

89
00:08:03.816 --> 00:08:06.683
You too have lived here
for over years.

90
00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.684
Wouldn't you wanted to
run away from here?

91
00:08:12.124 --> 00:08:17.084
How can I ever think of leaving
as you are here, sire.

92
00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:21.090
Her Majesty, the Queen.

93
00:08:31.744 --> 00:08:33.712
Have you slept well, sire?

94
00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:35.313
Welcome, my Queen.

95
00:08:37.617 --> 00:08:40.882
I brought some medicine
to bring down your fever, sire.

96
00:08:42.321 --> 00:08:44.585
No need to bring it in person.

97
00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:47.688
I shall leave in peace, sire.

98
00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:54.796
My physician prepared this
specially for you, sire.

99
00:08:56.736 --> 00:08:58.601
Thank you for your generosity.

100
00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:07.513
I heard an envoy
from Yuan is coming.

101
00:09:09.048 --> 00:09:09.980
Yes.

102
00:09:10.116 --> 00:09:14.382
What more will they demand
on account of the royal heir issue?

103
00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:17.080
It worries me so.

104
00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:20.386
Worrying will not solve anything.

105
00:09:22.428 --> 00:09:25.192
With all due respect, sire...

106
00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:32.498
Perhaps you should make
more effort for an heir...

107
00:09:33.039 --> 00:09:35.405
Shall I take in
another royal concubine?

108
00:09:46.719 --> 00:09:48.084
You wanted to see me?

109
00:09:48.721 --> 00:09:51.986
I heard you took care of
something I should've done.

110
00:09:53.426 --> 00:09:54.393
Pardon?

111
00:09:54.927 --> 00:09:57.987
My maid who was arrested for
running away with a guard.

112
00:09:58.331 --> 00:10:00.993
I heard she's alive
thanks to you.

113
00:10:01.534 --> 00:10:06.198
I wanted to thank you
for what you did.

114
00:10:06.339 --> 00:10:07.897
No, Your Majesty.

115
00:10:08.541 --> 00:10:12.307
I'm certain the King made
the decision with you in mind.

116
00:10:13.446 --> 00:10:15.004
We both know that's not true.

117
00:10:16.349 --> 00:10:18.180
However, remember this.

118
00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:21.485
There's much clamor
over the royal heir issue.

119
00:10:21.921 --> 00:10:26.290
Your service to the King can be
misunderstood at times like this.

120
00:10:26.826 --> 00:10:28.691
So be careful.

121
00:10:44.243 --> 00:10:46.905
The spring sun
is stunning, sire.

122
00:10:50.216 --> 00:10:52.275
We should've come here earlier.

123
00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.484
'Tis nice to be out
from the palace.

124
00:11:06.732 --> 00:11:07.892
That sachet...

125
00:11:09.135 --> 00:11:10.898
I haven't seen it in a while.

126
00:11:12.038 --> 00:11:13.596
Oh, this?

127
00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.208
Do you remember, sire?

128
00:11:16.342 --> 00:11:19.505
You wore that
when you first came from Yuan.

129
00:11:19.945 --> 00:11:23.779
It’s amazing that
it still carries its scent.

130
00:11:28.421 --> 00:11:29.479
My Queen.

131
00:11:30.723 --> 00:11:32.588
Would you care to sing?

132
00:11:33.225 --> 00:11:34.283
Sire?

133
00:11:34.827 --> 00:11:38.991
The Goryeo song you
always used to sing.

134
00:11:39.832 --> 00:11:44.201
It’s so unexpected,
you’re making me blush.

135
00:11:45.838 --> 00:11:48.500
What about you, Chief HONG?

136
00:11:48.641 --> 00:11:50.802
Would you like to hear
the Queen sing?

137
00:11:51.644 --> 00:11:54.204
Yes, Your Majesty.

138
00:11:55.948 --> 00:11:58.280
See? He wants to hear it, too.

139
00:11:58.918 --> 00:12:01.478
We'd be so obliged.

140
00:12:01.821 --> 00:12:03.982
Oh, dear...

141
00:12:14.834 --> 00:12:22.206
? Will you leave?

142
00:12:22.742 --> 00:12:29.807
? Will you leave me?

143
00:12:30.516 --> 00:12:40.084
? How will I live without you?

144
00:12:42.728 --> 00:12:52.399
? If you leave me now?

145
00:12:54.440 --> 00:13:02.211
? I wish to keep you from leaving.

146
00:13:02.548 --> 00:13:10.387
? Will you not return
if I look sad?

147
00:13:10.523 --> 00:13:11.581
? My love...

148
00:13:32.545 --> 00:13:34.206
- You okay?
- Yes, sire!

149
00:13:34.346 --> 00:13:35.813
Stop them!

150
00:13:38.217 --> 00:13:40.481
Protect the King!

151
00:14:31.337 --> 00:14:32.895
Escort the King!

152
00:14:33.439 --> 00:14:34.997
- Bring me my sword!
- But, sire!

153
00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.198
Bring it now!

154
00:14:36.342 --> 00:14:37.309
Your Majesty!

155
00:14:48.921 --> 00:14:50.388
Escort the Queen!

156
00:14:50.522 --> 00:14:51.489
Your Majesty!

157
00:14:51.624 --> 00:14:52.682
Hurry!

158
00:15:46.845 --> 00:15:49.405
HONG Lim, HONG Lim!

159
00:15:49.748 --> 00:15:50.874
Are you okay?

160
00:15:52.318 --> 00:15:53.478
Yes, sire.

161
00:16:43.635 --> 00:16:44.693
Sire!

162
00:16:44.837 --> 00:16:45.895
Sire!

163
00:16:46.338 --> 00:16:47.396
Sire!

164
00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:48.900
Sire!

165
00:16:49.041 --> 00:16:51.009
Your Majesty!

166
00:16:58.317 --> 00:16:59.784
How is he?

167
00:16:59.918 --> 00:17:01.886
He is still unconscious, sir.

168
00:17:02.021 --> 00:17:06.082
Only days until the Yuan
envoy arrives, this is a tragedy!

169
00:17:07.326 --> 00:17:08.384
You!

170
00:17:09.128 --> 00:17:11.187
How dare you sit here
with a straight face!

171
00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.891
How did you allow this tragedy
to fall upon the King?

172
00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:18.094
You still call yourself
the Chief of the Kunryongwe?

173
00:17:18.237 --> 00:17:23.903
I will have you and others
personally responsible for this!

174
00:17:27.646 --> 00:17:28.704
Chief HONG?

175
00:17:29.248 --> 00:17:31.079
His Majesty is calling for you.

176
00:17:40.726 --> 00:17:43.194
Are you okay?

177
00:17:44.329 --> 00:17:46.297
Did you get your wound treated?

178
00:17:49.435 --> 00:17:51.198
I deserve to die, sire.

179
00:17:52.237 --> 00:17:57.300
My incapacity to fulfill my
duties brought you harm.

180
00:17:58.744 --> 00:18:00.712
Please have me executed.

181
00:18:02.047 --> 00:18:03.878
No, dear lad.

182
00:18:05.918 --> 00:18:09.979
If you weren't there to save me,

183
00:18:10.522 --> 00:18:13.184
I'd already be dead.

184
00:18:16.128 --> 00:18:17.390
Your Majesty...

185
00:18:34.947 --> 00:18:36.676
Chief...

186
00:18:37.316 --> 00:18:38.681
Did you find out?

187
00:18:38.817 --> 00:18:40.182
Just as we expected, sir.

188
00:18:40.319 --> 00:18:43.584
Remember the raid
against the Japanese?

189
00:18:43.722 --> 00:18:45.587
The Privy Council is claiming...

190
00:18:45.724 --> 00:18:49.387
the remnants who escaped
are behind this.

191
00:18:52.831 --> 00:18:54.389
What are the ministers saying?

192
00:18:54.833 --> 00:18:56.892
What would the fools say?

193
00:18:57.035 --> 00:18:59.299
They're all waiting on Lord CHO.

194
00:18:59.438 --> 00:19:01.497
The court is filled
with scoundrels.

195
00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:06.209
Perhaps we can ask the King
to put Lord CHO on trial?

196
00:19:10.516 --> 00:19:12.984
Lord CHO is
under Yuan's protection.

197
00:19:13.118 --> 00:19:15.177
We can't touch him
without proper proof.

198
00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:18.789
Let's say that the Japanese
are behind this for now.

199
00:19:19.625 --> 00:19:23.686
Act as usual and
obtain the evidence discreetly.

200
00:19:24.429 --> 00:19:27.694
The Goryeo King shall
pay respects...

201
00:19:27.833 --> 00:19:31.792
to the Yuan Emperor's demands!

202
00:19:41.246 --> 00:19:43.476
Long live the Emperor.

203
00:19:43.615 --> 00:19:46.778
Long live the Emperor.

204
00:19:46.919 --> 00:19:52.687
A royal letter to my son-in-law,
the King of Goryeo.

205
00:19:52.824 --> 00:19:56.191
The Father of Yuan
who unified the world...

206
00:19:56.328 --> 00:19:58.193
knew well the will of Heaven...

207
00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.890
and took in all nations
under him.

208
00:20:01.033 --> 00:20:06.096
A century has passed...

209
00:20:06.238 --> 00:20:10.004
in alliance with Goryeo
through matrimony.

210
00:20:10.342 --> 00:20:13.505
Now, the Goryeo King
is without an heir...

211
00:20:13.645 --> 00:20:16.011
The woes of the citizens...

212
00:20:16.148 --> 00:20:18.878
are of my great concern.

213
00:20:19.017 --> 00:20:21.884
Thus, I have decided to enthrone...

214
00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:25.581
Lord Kyungwon as Crown Prince,

215
00:20:25.724 --> 00:20:31.185
and stabilize the Goryeo court.

216
00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:34.993
Also, to fight off barbarians...

217
00:20:35.133 --> 00:20:37.601
who threaten Yuan...

218
00:20:37.736 --> 00:20:42.002
dispatch, soldiers...

219
00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:45.109
and, maidens...

220
00:20:45.544 --> 00:20:49.105
in respects to thy father nation!

221
00:20:51.917 --> 00:20:53.680
Sending soldiers and maidens

222
00:20:55.721 --> 00:20:57.689
will not last long.

223
00:20:57.823 --> 00:21:02.886
Yuan will make even more demands
using the heir issue as an excuse.

224
00:21:03.028 --> 00:21:06.794
Hence, appointing Lord Kyungwon
as the Crown Prince quickly...

225
00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:11.995
and stabilizing the court
is the most viable option, sire.

226
00:21:12.137 --> 00:21:15.402
Any other thoughts?

227
00:21:19.344 --> 00:21:21.005
I have something to say.

228
00:21:22.147 --> 00:21:26.481
Are you the King's subjects?
Or Lord Kyungwon's subjects?

229
00:21:27.019 --> 00:21:30.477
My lack of virtue
has left me without an heir.

230
00:21:31.023 --> 00:21:34.288
However!
His Majesty is yet young.

231
00:21:34.426 --> 00:21:37.395
But you ask to enthrone one
who is not of direct descent?

232
00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.994
Tell him to give up the throne!

233
00:21:41.633 --> 00:21:43.999
That's what you all really
want to say, is it not!

234
00:21:58.216 --> 00:21:59.979
You've drunk much, sire.

235
00:22:06.425 --> 00:22:10.088
I shall sleep here, tonight.

236
00:22:18.537 --> 00:22:20.596
Return to Yuan.

237
00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:23.905
As you may already know...

238
00:22:24.643 --> 00:22:27.305
I am incapable of taking a woman.

239
00:22:27.846 --> 00:22:30.576
Hence,
to get an heir is hopeless.

240
00:22:31.316 --> 00:22:34.080
Eventually, everything will be
as Yuan wishes.

241
00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:37.582
If Lord Kyungwon becomes
the Crown Prince...

242
00:22:38.023 --> 00:22:40.685
I shall be a king only in name.

243
00:22:41.326 --> 00:22:45.695
What glory would there be
at my side?

244
00:22:45.931 --> 00:22:48.092
Before things get worse...

245
00:22:49.234 --> 00:22:50.997
go back to your home country.

246
00:22:51.937 --> 00:22:54.497
I am now a citizen of Goryeo.

247
00:22:56.341 --> 00:23:00.004
How could I leave this palace
that I call home?

248
00:23:00.746 --> 00:23:06.082
Then how much longer will you
endure this humiliation?

249
00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.802
My Queen.

250
00:23:31.843 --> 00:23:33.003
Yes?

251
00:23:33.645 --> 00:23:36.011
We are not without options.

252
00:24:43.515 --> 00:24:47.781
For the future,
it's the only way.

253
00:24:50.121 --> 00:24:51.179
Your Majesty...

254
00:24:51.323 --> 00:24:53.689
What are you saying, sire?

255
00:24:54.326 --> 00:24:57.193
Who else can I trust but you?

256
00:24:59.231 --> 00:25:01.096
I want you to serve the Queen.

257
00:25:01.233 --> 00:25:02.791
No, sire!

258
00:25:04.736 --> 00:25:05.998
I cannot do it.

259
00:26:10.535 --> 00:26:13.197
Is Majesty has arrived.

260
00:26:33.325 --> 00:26:36.089
Ten o'clock!

261
00:26:40.932 --> 00:26:43.696
Ten o'clock!

262
00:26:48.740 --> 00:26:51.504
Ten o'clock!

263
00:27:25.644 --> 00:27:26.906
Go in.

264
00:29:36.441 --> 00:29:37.908
Did you serve the Queen well?

265
00:29:40.044 --> 00:29:41.511
Forgive me, sire.

266
00:29:44.516 --> 00:29:46.279
You couldn't do it?

267
00:29:54.325 --> 00:29:56.589
There are only two chances left.

268
00:29:57.929 --> 00:29:59.897
So pull yourself together.

269
00:30:01.032 --> 00:30:03.500
May I ask a question, sire?

270
00:30:03.635 --> 00:30:05.000
You may.

271
00:30:07.238 --> 00:30:10.696
Why did you choose me?

272
00:30:14.445 --> 00:30:16.675
The child she'll have

273
00:30:17.015 --> 00:30:20.075
must be as fair as you.

274
00:30:26.524 --> 00:30:29.186
Midnight.

275
00:30:34.232 --> 00:30:36.894
Midnight.

276
00:30:41.940 --> 00:30:43.407
I will do it.

277
00:36:51.342 --> 00:36:52.604
Morning, lad.

278
00:36:52.743 --> 00:36:54.506
Have you slept well, sire?

279
00:36:54.946 --> 00:36:58.074
Yes, indeed I have.

280
00:36:59.217 --> 00:37:02.277
And you? How does it feel
to become a man?

281
00:37:09.227 --> 00:37:12.685
What was it like to hold
a woman for the first time?

282
00:37:15.132 --> 00:37:16.997
There is nothing to say, sire.

283
00:37:17.134 --> 00:37:20.900
I served in accordance
to your orders.

284
00:37:23.941 --> 00:37:27.900
I wish to visit Byuklan-do
for a few days.

285
00:37:32.917 --> 00:37:34.179
Why?

286
00:37:34.819 --> 00:37:37.379
I've been neglecting
my duties as the Chief.

287
00:37:37.922 --> 00:37:41.380
I'd like to personally investigate
the attack, sire.

288
00:37:50.334 --> 00:37:51.301
Not interested.

289
00:38:09.520 --> 00:38:14.287
One of the biggest merchants
around suddenly disappeared.

290
00:38:14.425 --> 00:38:16.393
He went out to meet
some noble person...

291
00:38:16.527 --> 00:38:18.995
and was never seen after that.

292
00:38:20.231 --> 00:38:23.997
Do you know where
merchant MA's family is?

293
00:38:58.736 --> 00:39:01.296
I have something
to report, sire.

294
00:39:03.441 --> 00:39:04.908
What is it?

295
00:39:05.242 --> 00:39:09.906
A merchant who smuggled
Japanese weapons was found dead.

296
00:39:11.315 --> 00:39:13.180
His name is MA Young-Gil.

297
00:39:13.317 --> 00:39:17.777
It's possible that the perpetrators
killed him to cover their tracks.

298
00:39:21.025 --> 00:39:24.893
Have you found any ministers
who are connected to him?

299
00:39:25.529 --> 00:39:28.396
We are investigating, sire.

300
00:39:29.133 --> 00:39:31.795
It could be the lead we need.

301
00:39:35.139 --> 00:39:37.107
When did Chief HONG say
he'll be back?

302
00:40:40.137 --> 00:40:42.002
He's running quite late.

303
00:40:42.540 --> 00:40:47.307
Please go inside and rest, sire.
It's getting late.

304
00:40:47.945 --> 00:40:51.472
What if something
happened to him?

305
00:40:53.417 --> 00:40:56.181
Go check on him, Seung-Ki.

306
00:40:57.822 --> 00:40:58.880
Yes, sire.

307
00:41:03.427 --> 00:41:04.485
HONG Lim?

308
00:41:17.842 --> 00:41:19.605
What brings you here, sire?

309
00:41:21.846 --> 00:41:23.780
I was anxious.

310
00:41:23.914 --> 00:41:27.782
What were you doing this late?

311
00:41:28.519 --> 00:41:32.785
I was so worried something
had happened to you.

312
00:41:37.127 --> 00:41:38.492
Is something the matter?

313
00:41:41.632 --> 00:41:42.894
No, sir.

314
00:41:45.936 --> 00:41:47.995
You must be going
through a lot.

315
00:41:49.540 --> 00:41:52.202
Let's return to the palace
at daybreak.

316
00:42:39.924 --> 00:42:40.891
Chief?

317
00:42:44.228 --> 00:42:46.196
What's that you're hiding?

318
00:42:49.333 --> 00:42:51.494
Shouldn’t you be preparing
for the banquet?

319
00:42:51.635 --> 00:42:54.502
It's been cancelled, sir.

320
00:42:54.838 --> 00:42:55.702
Why?

321
00:42:55.839 --> 00:42:58.399
Just a moment ago His Majesty
went back to see the Queen.

322
00:42:59.043 --> 00:43:02.103
- Why?
- She's said to be quite ill.

323
00:43:04.915 --> 00:43:06.473
You have a high fever.

324
00:43:08.819 --> 00:43:13.586
You must have exhausted
yourself during the ritual.

325
00:43:15.726 --> 00:43:16.693
Wait.

326
00:43:18.128 --> 00:43:21.791
It could be a sign of
morning sickness.

327
00:43:23.033 --> 00:43:25.092
Perhaps you're pregnant?

328
00:43:30.641 --> 00:43:32.404
Forgive me, sire.

329
00:43:34.044 --> 00:43:35.306
Actually...

330
00:43:36.347 --> 00:43:40.477
my menstruation started
a few days ago.

331
00:43:41.819 --> 00:43:44.185
So you have not conceived?

332
00:43:45.923 --> 00:43:47.083
No, sire.

333
00:43:49.226 --> 00:43:53.492
There'll be a feast to pray
for the royal conception soon.

334
00:43:53.631 --> 00:43:56.600
Keep this a secret for now.

335
00:43:56.734 --> 00:44:01.194
Yes, sire. I'll arrange the
consummation date after the feast.

336
00:44:03.140 --> 00:44:06.803
Honeysuckle tea
is good for fevers.

337
00:44:07.244 --> 00:44:11.681
Make some for the Queen.

338
00:44:11.815 --> 00:44:13.180
Yes, Your Majesty.

339
00:44:14.318 --> 00:44:18.687
But drinking too much won't
make a difference, sire.

340
00:44:21.725 --> 00:44:22.987
What do you mean?

341
00:44:23.127 --> 00:44:27.291
Chief HONG took some
this afternoon.

342
00:44:27.431 --> 00:44:30.195
Was it not meant
for the Queen, sire?

343
00:44:47.017 --> 00:44:49.781
Where are you going?

344
00:44:51.522 --> 00:44:53.285
Were you not asleep, sire?

345
00:44:54.625 --> 00:44:55.683
No.

346
00:44:57.628 --> 00:45:01.394
I have something to
finish up in my room.

347
00:45:02.533 --> 00:45:05.400
The honeysuckle tea
you gave me earlier...

348
00:45:06.737 --> 00:45:07.704
Yes?

349
00:45:08.639 --> 00:45:11.005
It worked well on my cold.

350
00:45:11.742 --> 00:45:14.905
Why don’t you send some
to the Queen?

351
00:45:17.715 --> 00:45:20.878
I'm sure the court physician
will serve her well, sire.

352
00:45:24.922 --> 00:45:25.980
You're right.

353
00:45:27.825 --> 00:45:30.487
It wouldn't look good for you
to send her some.

354
00:45:39.336 --> 00:45:43.796
You both went through
ha lot of trouble.

355
00:45:44.641 --> 00:45:49.408
However, despite your efforts,
the result was inadequate.

356
00:45:50.214 --> 00:45:54.776
A new date for consummation
has been set.

357
00:45:56.120 --> 00:45:57.280
But...

358
00:45:57.821 --> 00:46:00.381
I am reluctant this time.

359
00:46:01.825 --> 00:46:05.386
It had a great toll
on the Queen's health.

360
00:46:06.130 --> 00:46:09.896
I fear it could make things worse.

361
00:46:10.834 --> 00:46:15.100
So let us postpone this
for a while.

362
00:46:18.742 --> 00:46:20.607
What do you think, my Queen?

363
00:46:22.246 --> 00:46:24.771
What could I say,
Your Majesty?

364
00:46:25.816 --> 00:46:27.784
Do as you wish, sire.

365
00:46:29.920 --> 00:46:31.581
What do you think, lad?

366
00:46:35.325 --> 00:46:37.691
I shall do as you command.

367
00:47:17.634 --> 00:47:19.795
I apologize for coming
without notice, Your Majesty.

368
00:47:19.937 --> 00:47:23.202
No need.
What brings you here?

369
00:47:23.340 --> 00:47:27.504
I heard you were sick and
came to check your condition.

370
00:47:30.214 --> 00:47:35.277
Thank you for the honeysuckle tea
you sent through Bo-Duk.

371
00:47:36.920 --> 00:47:40.378
Any court subject would
do the same.

372
00:47:42.526 --> 00:47:43.891
Ah, here...

373
00:47:49.433 --> 00:47:50.798
What's this?

374
00:47:51.335 --> 00:47:52.893
It is a perfume sachet.

375
00:47:53.637 --> 00:47:54.695
A sachet?

376
00:47:55.539 --> 00:47:59.202
I heard during the attack...

377
00:47:59.743 --> 00:48:02.712
you lost your treasured sachet.

378
00:48:03.513 --> 00:48:07.574
I found a similar one during
my rounds outside the palace.

379
00:48:08.819 --> 00:48:11.583
How very thoughtful.

380
00:48:12.422 --> 00:48:13.582
It's nothing, madam.

381
00:48:14.524 --> 00:48:17.084
I'll leave you to rest.

382
00:48:31.742 --> 00:48:37.772
We, all your subjects
and your people pray for

383
00:48:37.915 --> 00:48:43.581
you having a prince who can
succeed to the Royal line.

384
00:48:43.921 --> 00:48:47.482
Long live the King!

385
00:48:47.624 --> 00:48:49.888
We pray!

386
00:49:55.726 --> 00:49:59.787
Tae-Ahn has become
almost Goryeo people.

387
00:50:00.430 --> 00:50:02.591
He dances well.

388
00:50:08.338 --> 00:50:09.396
Well...

389
00:50:10.340 --> 00:50:12.706
How did you find your sachet?

390
00:50:13.643 --> 00:50:20.481
My brother brought me
a similar one from Yuan.

391
00:50:21.118 --> 00:50:23.780
I see.

392
00:50:25.022 --> 00:50:27.991
Perhaps we shouldn't have
held this feast.

393
00:50:28.125 --> 00:50:31.788
What if the Queen really
bears a child?

394
00:50:31.928 --> 00:50:36.888
If such feasts had worked,
there would already be an heir.

395
00:50:38.835 --> 00:50:42.202
Look at those concubines.

396
00:50:42.939 --> 00:50:45.499
Even Buddha's grace won't
get them an heir.

397
00:50:47.444 --> 00:50:51.778
But it's so quiet in palace.

398
00:50:52.716 --> 00:50:57.881
Because His Majesty's
so concerned about heir.

399
00:50:59.523 --> 00:51:04.483
In any case, we must enthrone
Lord Kyungwon at once.

400
00:51:04.628 --> 00:51:07.392
Hence, we need
solid grounds to do so.

401
00:51:09.733 --> 00:51:10.995
How about...

402
00:51:11.835 --> 00:51:14.895
bringing in the Queens brother?

403
00:51:15.038 --> 00:51:16.505
Lord Tae-Ahn?

404
00:51:25.315 --> 00:51:26.282
Chief!

405
00:51:27.317 --> 00:51:29.877
The flower cakes are delicious.
Try some.

406
00:51:30.020 --> 00:51:31.078
No thanks.

407
00:51:31.621 --> 00:51:34.488
All set to perform
the sword dance?

408
00:51:34.825 --> 00:51:36.292
Yes, sir.

409
00:51:37.327 --> 00:51:38.294
Let's go.

410
00:51:42.632 --> 00:51:43.792
Chief HONG?

411
00:51:46.336 --> 00:51:47.496
Ah...

412
00:53:24.434 --> 00:53:26.493
- Welcome.
- Your Majesty.

413
00:53:26.636 --> 00:53:31.096
May I offer up a drink,
Your Majesty?

414
00:54:46.516 --> 00:54:50.680
I beg you for the first time.

415
00:54:50.820 --> 00:54:52.981
Please.

416
00:54:53.423 --> 00:54:57.189
I don't want to ruin
this enjoyable atmosphere.

417
00:54:57.327 --> 00:55:00.194
Please rise and enjoy
the festivities.

418
00:55:00.330 --> 00:55:01.592
Your Majesty.

419
00:55:01.731 --> 00:55:06.600
Even the late King took pleasure
in singing and dancing at times.

420
00:55:06.736 --> 00:55:08.795
Will you grace us a song?

421
00:55:13.743 --> 00:55:15.108
This is for you.

422
00:55:17.814 --> 00:55:21.181
What is it, Your Majesty?

423
00:55:21.718 --> 00:55:24.186
It is a handkerchief
I embroidered myself.

424
00:55:26.323 --> 00:55:28.587
I hope you
always keep it on you.

425
00:55:37.133 --> 00:55:39.192
I'll be here again
at midnight, tomorrow.

426
00:55:47.143 --> 00:55:50.010
? I went in to a shop

427
00:55:50.213 --> 00:55:57.779
? to buy some flower cakes.

428
00:55:59.122 --> 00:56:10.192
? A man grabbed my wrist.

429
00:56:11.334 --> 00:56:21.710
? If word got out

430
00:56:23.046 --> 00:56:29.076
? the young errand boy

431
00:56:29.219 --> 00:56:35.089
? would have told.

432
00:56:35.225 --> 00:56:44.099
? I shall go to sleep there, too.

433
00:56:47.137 --> 00:56:56.011
? I shall go to sleep there, too.

434
00:56:59.115 --> 00:57:02.084
? I went into a temple

435
00:57:02.218 --> 00:57:09.590
? to light it.

436
00:57:11.327 --> 00:57:13.989
? The temple owner

437
00:57:14.130 --> 00:57:22.094
? grabbed my wrist.

438
00:57:23.239 --> 00:57:26.106
? If word got out

439
00:57:26.242 --> 00:57:33.671
? the temple,

440
00:57:35.218 --> 00:57:41.088
? the young monk

441
00:57:41.224 --> 00:57:46.890
? would have told.

442
00:57:47.530 --> 00:57:55.904
? I shall go to sleep there, too.

443
00:57:59.342 --> 00:58:06.976
? I shall go to sleep there, too.

444
00:58:11.120 --> 00:58:15.181
Try tile fish from Jeju Island.
It's delectable.

445
00:58:15.325 --> 00:58:18.692
I will get it myself, sire.

446
00:58:19.229 --> 00:58:21.697
You don't eat
the good food on purpose.

447
00:58:22.332 --> 00:58:23.594
Try it.

448
00:58:24.434 --> 00:58:25.492
Yes, sire.

449
00:58:30.840 --> 00:58:33.308
The new clothes suit you well.

450
00:58:33.843 --> 00:58:35.208
Do you like it?

451
00:58:35.845 --> 00:58:36.869
Yes, sire.

452
00:58:43.620 --> 00:58:48.080
A delightful gift for you
shall be arriving tomorrow.

453
00:58:48.525 --> 00:58:51.585
The Sub-Chief to see you, sire.

454
00:58:57.734 --> 00:58:59.099
What brings you here?

455
00:59:02.539 --> 00:59:03.904
I've come to
make a report, sire.

456
00:59:05.041 --> 00:59:06.303
About what?

457
00:59:06.442 --> 00:59:09.969
We found out who MA smuggled
weapons to before getting killed.

458
00:59:11.014 --> 00:59:12.379
Who is it?

459
00:59:14.317 --> 00:59:16.979
Minister KI Won-Hong's
steward, sire.

460
00:59:18.621 --> 00:59:19.986
KI Won-Hong?

461
00:59:25.328 --> 00:59:31.995
Lord Kyungwon wants a signed
covenant from the ministers.

462
00:59:32.635 --> 00:59:37.299
That will surely change
the Emperor's mind.

463
00:59:37.941 --> 00:59:40.705
We all support Lord Kyungwon.

464
00:59:40.843 --> 00:59:44.574
But will we be enough?

465
00:59:47.617 --> 00:59:51.781
Right under our noses.
Treacherous fiends!

466
01:00:37.834 --> 01:00:40.496
Your nephew's birthday?

467
01:00:40.837 --> 01:00:41.997
Of course you should go.

468
01:00:42.739 --> 01:00:45.105
Thank you
for your permission, sire.

469
01:00:45.241 --> 01:00:49.701
It would be splendid if you could
grace us with your presence.

470
01:00:51.614 --> 01:00:53.980
How long will you be staying?

471
01:00:55.618 --> 01:00:57.779
I dare not leave
the palace for long, sire.

472
01:00:57.920 --> 01:00:59.581
Good morning, sir.

473
01:01:03.826 --> 01:01:08.695
Cleanse your troubling thoughts
and rest easy at home.

474
01:01:10.133 --> 01:01:12.294
Make preparations to go, then.

475
01:01:12.635 --> 01:01:15.195
Yes, Your Majesty.

476
01:01:15.338 --> 01:01:17.397
Thank you, sire.

477
01:01:35.925 --> 01:01:38.189
I've come to report
on the tailing last night.

478
01:01:40.029 --> 01:01:42.395
The Sub-Chief
has already informed me.

479
01:01:43.533 --> 01:01:46.400
He said you left for
the palace earlier.

480
01:01:46.536 --> 01:01:48.504
Why report to me so late?

481
01:01:50.740 --> 01:01:52.105
Forgive me, sire.

482
01:01:53.042 --> 01:01:58.070
I arrived very late.
I was afraid to wake you.

483
01:01:58.514 --> 01:02:01.574
You've been in my chambers
for over years.

484
01:02:02.118 --> 01:02:04.484
Since when did you
use formalities?

485
01:02:28.544 --> 01:02:29.806
This is the horse?

486
01:02:30.113 --> 01:02:31.273
Yes, Your Majesty.

487
01:02:35.418 --> 01:02:37.283
She's a real beauty.

488
01:02:38.321 --> 01:02:40.789
Chief HONG will be so pleased
to see her.

489
01:02:41.224 --> 01:02:46.093
Please forgive me, but it may be
a better horse than your own.

490
01:02:48.030 --> 01:02:51.591
Bring Chief HONG at once.
I want to see him ride it.

491
01:02:54.036 --> 01:02:57.995
Where did Lord Tae-Ahn go
at this late hour?

492
01:02:58.141 --> 01:03:02.510
It's not like the Queen
comes here every day.

493
01:03:02.945 --> 01:03:07.177
I heard he's been
up to something as of late.

494
01:03:09.919 --> 01:03:11.079
Chief HONG!

495
01:03:12.021 --> 01:03:14.387
I apologize for startling you.

496
01:03:15.725 --> 01:03:17.090
Leave us, Bo-Duk.

497
01:03:18.227 --> 01:03:19.592
Yes, Your Majesty.

498
01:03:25.034 --> 01:03:26.296
How did you...

499
01:05:52.715 --> 01:05:56.879
I heard that chief Hong
went out at sunset.

500
01:05:58.821 --> 01:06:02.279
Okay, leave.

501
01:06:08.130 --> 01:06:09.688
Do you have something to say?

502
01:06:10.933 --> 01:06:13.493
Offer me a drink, Your Majesty.

503
01:06:33.322 --> 01:06:36.291
When will we ever get
to meet like this, again?

504
01:06:37.426 --> 01:06:39.485
I'll pour you a drink
before you go.

505
01:06:51.640 --> 01:06:54.507
Do you know
how much I despised you?

506
01:06:57.313 --> 01:06:59.281
When I first came from Yuan...

507
01:06:59.715 --> 01:07:02.582
I only had the King to depend on.

508
01:07:03.519 --> 01:07:06.886
But he only had eyes for you.

509
01:07:08.324 --> 01:07:10.986
It was only natural
that I resented you.

510
01:07:17.033 --> 01:07:20.992
I made this myself.
Try it.

511
01:07:22.538 --> 01:07:24.301
Flower rice cakes?

512
01:07:26.242 --> 01:07:32.579
It's a Yuan custom to give
this to the one you love.

513
01:07:33.315 --> 01:07:38.378
I've always wanted to make this
like other women.

514
01:07:45.628 --> 01:07:48.995
Here, try it.

515
01:08:10.820 --> 01:08:13.983
You don't like it?

516
01:08:16.826 --> 01:08:17.986
No, Your Majesty.

517
01:08:21.230 --> 01:08:22.891
It's exquisite.

518
01:08:30.139 --> 01:08:31.197
Your Majesty.

519
01:08:34.243 --> 01:08:36.677
Why do you only
favor chief Hong?

520
01:08:37.012 --> 01:08:39.276
Am I not better than him?

521
01:08:40.216 --> 01:08:41.683
What are you talking about?

522
01:08:43.519 --> 01:08:45.680
I do favor you, too.

523
01:08:46.922 --> 01:08:50.983
I want to serve
Your Majesty tonight.

524
01:08:52.928 --> 01:08:55.795
They say 'The King is the land.'

525
01:08:59.435 --> 01:09:01.198
Please allow me.

526
01:09:07.243 --> 01:09:08.801
Leave.

527
01:09:56.525 --> 01:09:58.186
What brings you here, sire?

528
01:09:58.928 --> 01:10:00.987
Where have you been all night?

529
01:10:04.733 --> 01:10:07.099
I asked you where you were.

530
01:10:09.738 --> 01:10:12.502
I read a book on military tactics
in the library.

531
01:10:16.145 --> 01:10:18.079
Which book was that?

532
01:10:20.816 --> 01:10:22.579
'The Six Secret Strategies', sire.

533
01:10:24.019 --> 01:10:28.683
Which among the six
did you find most amusing?

534
01:10:32.828 --> 01:10:34.989
The politic and
the raid strategies, sire.

535
01:10:36.232 --> 01:10:38.393
